{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56867","headline":"长道县人爲王田二公歌 · 佚名","name":"长道县人爲王田二公歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二公更事，阖境之庇。\n二公其休，谁其爲嗣。\n（见《文苑英华》卷七九三于邵《田司马传》引）（〖1〗《田司马传》：「司马姓田氏，名某，字某。\n……知长道县事，……在公之勤，岁寒不易，嘉声美政，益震於曩时。\n……时特进鸿胪卿兼刺史太原王公，劳於取人，逸於用人，前後褒贬，无有不当。\n田公虽让德有余，而王公混日不足，遂举摄司马仍知县事。\n……故人歌之曰〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}